  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Brand introduction:Mcateyenail<br>&bull; Product description:Cat Eye Nail Gel (UV Dry)<br>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">Long-Lasting &amp; Fresh Finish</strong>: Our long-lasting formula ensures that your nails remain bright and fresh for days, giving you a beautiful, enduring manicure.&bull; Payment terms: Paypal<br><br></p>\r\n<ul style=\"box-sizing: inherit; list-style-position: inside; padding-left: 2rem; color: rgba(46, 42, 57, 0.75); font-family: 'Harmonia Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: normal;\">\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\"></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgba(46, 42, 57, 0.75); font-family: 'Harmonia Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: normal;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;How to Use</strong>:</p>\r\n<ol style=\"box-sizing: inherit; list-style-position: inside; padding-left: 2rem; color: rgba(46, 42, 57, 0.75); font-family: 'Harmonia Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: normal;\">\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; list-style: inherit;\">Start by cleaning your nails and applying a base coat.</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; list-style: inherit;\">Apply the Fruit Candy Series cat eye nail gel for a fresh burst of color.</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; list-style: inherit;\">Use the magnet to create a soft cat eye effect, bringing the color to life.</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">Finish with a top coat to lock in the freshness and shine.</li>\r\n</ol>",
